[test_rule_b]
a Config class key	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a Config class key].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a class keyword the signature does not list	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a class keyword the signature does not list].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a configuration dictionary	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a configuration dictionary].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a configuration dictionary that unpacks another	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a configuration dictionary that unpacks another].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a configuration key the signature does not list	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a configuration key the signature does not list].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a configuration key the signature lists	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a configuration key the signature lists].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
a configuration of a name	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a configuration of a name].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a decorator, the signatures equal	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a decorator, the signatures equal].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a default factory's body, the signatures equal	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a default factory's body, the signatures equal].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a field default spelled otherwise, the signatures equal	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a field default spelled otherwise, the signatures equal].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
a field type, the signatures differ	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a field type, the signatures differ].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a getter's and a setter's bodies traded	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a getter's and a setter's bodies traded].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
a nested union flattened	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a nested union flattened].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
a union spelled otherwise with the same members	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a union spelled otherwise with the same members].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
a validator's body, the signatures equal	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[a validator's body, the signatures equal].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
an import moved past a statement it shadows	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[an import moved past a statement it shadows].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
docstrings and comments	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[docstrings and comments].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
same text	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[same text].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
text that does not parse	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[text that does not parse].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
the members of a field's union in another order	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[the members of a field's union in another order].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
the members of a root model's union in another order	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[the members of a root model's union in another order].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
the order of the imports	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[the order of the imports].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
two aliases in another order	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[two aliases in another order].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
two aliases' union orders traded	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[two aliases' union orders traded].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
two classes in another order	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[two classes in another order].txt	= main/generation_platform/api_scope/leaf-mapping.txt
two fields' default factories traded	behaviour_diff_script/rule_b[two fields' default factories traded].txt	= behaviour_diff_script/covers[an option set in another order].txt
